  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.9,
      464.88,
      286.36,
      537.33
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.9,
      536.99,
      288.76,
      643.31
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired :- Allotment of land called in extent 0.4085 Hectare described below and depicted in Zone No. 5, Sheet No. 2, of Cadastral Map No. 910182, situated in the Village of Arali Center J/161, in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Valikamam West, Chankanai in the District of Jaffna in Northern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.9,
      643.03,
      286.51,
      718.31
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1 Name of the land : Thumpalai; Description : Permanent building 02, Massonry well 02, Overhead water tank 01; Names of the claimant : Department of Indigenous Medicine, Northern Province; Extent: 0.4085 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      6.0,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      415.88,
      539.71,
      543.45
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Valikamam West, Divisional Secretariat, Chankanai on the 25th day of March 2026 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 11th day of March 2026, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. All deeds and other documents in support of claim should be produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      543.17,
      525.21,
      724.55
    ],
    "text": "Kavitha Uthayakumar, Divisional Secretary, Valikamam West, Chankanai. At Divisional Secretariat, Valikamam West, Chankanai. 11th February, 2026. EOG 02 - 0106",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      5.039999961853027,
